SUMMARY:THE WEAVE - A Malvern Buzzards Grand Day Out!
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sim Buzzard\n\nAre you ready to take on The Weave?\n\nS
 tarting in Stourbridge and going to all five (current) Weavers Real Ale Hou
 se (Stourbridge\, Bewdley\, Kidderminster\, Worcester and Malvern). Shortes
 t route about 34 miles.\n\nIf you want shorter options\, they are available
 .\n\nStourbridge to Bewdley about 9 miles THE WALTZ\nBewdley to Kidderminst
 er about 4 miles THE WHIZZ\nKidderminster to Worcester about 14 miles THE W
 ADDLE \nWorcester to Malvern about 8 miles THE WOBBLE\n\nDrink in each.\n\n
 Raising funds for Cardiac Risk in the Young (CRY) in memory of Matthew Notl
 ey. Please try and raise or donate at least £34 (pound a mile).\n\nWhether
  you want to go for the Fastest Known Time or plan the shortest possible ro
 ute or just have a grand social\, this proves to be a huge event.\n\nThe We
 avers team are backing us and will be giving a warm welcome at each checkpo
 int. \n\nShorter versions available if you only want to do a couple of stop
 s. \n\nPre-run train ride on the Stourbridge branch line. \n\nGather at Sto
 urbridge Weavers for noon\, event will start at 1230.\n\nAll welcome.\n\nSi
 m Buzzard \n[Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3498740185001286416\n\nSynced from Strava Club
  208705 on Wed\, 8 Jul @ 9:44 AM
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Leader: Sim BuzzardAre you ready to take on Th
 e Weave?Starting in Stourbridge and going to all five (current) Weavers Rea
 l Ale House (Stourbridge\, Bewdley\, Kidderminster\, Worcester and Malvern)
 . Shortest route about 34 miles.If you want shorter options\, they are avai
 lable.Stourbridge to Bewdley about 9 miles THE WALTZBewdley to Kidderminste
 r about 4 miles THE WHIZZKidderminster to Worcester about 14 miles THE WADD
 LE Worcester to Malvern about 8 miles THE WOBBLEDrink in each.Raising funds
  for Cardiac Risk in the Young (CRY) in memory of Matthew Notley. Please tr
